Description
Research the existing Canada integration process in OneStream and identify the changes required to support the new Canada acquisition.
Review how data can be loaded for the new entity and associated GL accounts using the current integration framework.
Identify any required updates to entity/account mappings, transformation rules, workflow, or existing business rules.
Document any dependencies, gaps, or additional information needed from the business before development can begin.
Provide the recommended technical approach for implementing the new entity and GL account integration.

Acceptance Criteria

Existing Canada integration is reviewed and all required changes for the new entity and GL accounts are identified.
Required configuration, mapping, and development updates are documented along with any dependencies or open questions.
A recommended implementation approach is provided and reviewed with the BSA/team.
